    "Only an owner gives the manager, administrator or owner roles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seul un propriétaire donne les rôles de gestionnaire, d'administrateur ou de propriétaire."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur ein:e Eigentümer:in vergibt die Rollen Manager:in, Administrator:in oder Eigentümer:in."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo un propietario asigna los roles de gestor, administrador o propietario."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo un proprietario assegna i ruoli di gestore, amministratore o proprietario."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the first 5 characters of each password's SHA-1 hash leave the iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seuls les 5 premiers caractères de l'empreinte SHA-1 de chaque mot de passe quittent l'iPhone."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur die ersten 5 Zeichen des SHA-1-Hashs jedes Passworts verlassen das iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo salen del iPhone los 5 primeros caracteres del hash SHA-1 de cada contraseña."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo i primi 5 caratteri dell'hash SHA-1 di ogni password lasciano l'iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only this exact address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seulement cette adresse exacte."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur genau diese Adresse."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo esta dirección exacta."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo questo indirizzo esatto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@, subject “Join …”, copy the link that follows “Click here to join” then paste it here. Nothing received? Look in spam, or ask for the invitation to be sent again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez %@, sujet « Join … », copiez le lien qui suit « Click here to join » puis collez-le ici. Rien reçu ? Regardez dans les indésirables, ou demandez de renvoyer l'invitation."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne %@, Betreff „Join …“, kopiere den Link nach „Click here to join“ und füge ihn hier ein. Nichts erhalten? Sieh im Spam-Ordner nach oder bitte darum, die Einladung erneut zu senden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre %@, asunto “Join …”, copia el enlace que sigue a “Click here to join” y pégalo aquí. ¿No has recibido nada? Mira en la carpeta de correo no deseado o pide que vuelvan a enviar la invitación."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri %@, oggetto “Join …”, copia il link che segue “Click here to join” e incollalo qui. Non hai ricevuto nulla? Controlla nella posta indesiderata o chiedi di inviare di nuovo l'invito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir Réglages"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen öffnen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir Ajustes"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri Impostazioni"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Verrou and sign in to your Vaultwarden server: your logins will then be offered here. The app must be a build signed by your developer team (see the guide).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez Verrou et connectez-vous à votre serveur Vaultwarden : vos identifiants seront alors proposés ici. L'app doit être un build signé par votre équipe de développeur (voir le guide)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne Verrou und melde dich bei deinem Vaultwarden-Server an: Deine Logins werden dann hier angeboten. Die App muss ein von deinem Entwicklerteam signierter Build sein (siehe Anleitung)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Verrou e inicia sesión en tu servidor Vaultwarden: entonces se te ofrecerán aquí tus inicios de sesión. La app debe ser una compilación firmada por tu equipo de desarrollo (consulta la guía)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri Verrou e accedi al tuo server Vaultwarden: i tuoi login verranno poi proposti qui. L'app deve essere una build firmata dal tuo team di sviluppo (vedi la guida)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Verrou and unlock your vault first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez d'abord Verrou et déverrouillez votre coffre."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne zuerst Verrou und entsperre deinen Tresor."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre primero Verrou y desbloquea tu bóveda."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri prima Verrou e sblocca la tua cassaforte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open in Safari": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir dans Safari"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Safari öffnen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir en Safari"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri in Safari"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Verrou app and sign in to your Vaultwarden server: your logins will then be offered here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez l'app Verrou et connectez-vous à votre serveur Vaultwarden : vos identifiants seront alors proposés ici."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne die Verrou-App und melde dich bei deinem Vaultwarden-Server an: Deine Logins werden dann hier angeboten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre la app Verrou e inicia sesión en tu servidor Vaultwarden: entonces se te ofrecerán aquí tus inicios de sesión."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri l'app Verrou e accedi al tuo server Vaultwarden: i tuoi login verranno poi proposti qui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Verrou on the search, with the text if you give one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre Verrou sur la recherche, avec le texte si vous en donnez un."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet Verrou bei der Suche, mit dem Text, falls du einen angibst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Verrou en la búsqueda, con el texto si das uno."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre Verrou sulla ricerca, con il testo se ne indichi uno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Verrou, which unlocks with Face ID, then copies the password of the item. Shortcuts never receives it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre Verrou, qui se déverrouille avec Face ID, puis copie le mot de passe de l'élément. Raccourcis ne le reçoit jamais."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet Verrou, das sich mit Face ID entsperrt, und kopiert dann das Passwort des Eintrags. Kurzbefehle erhält es nie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Verrou, que se desbloquea con Face ID, y copia la contraseña del elemento. Atajos nunca la recibe."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre Verrou, che si sblocca con Face ID, poi copia la password dell'elemento. Comandi Rapidi non la riceve mai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the request from your Mac in Verrou, to approve it with Face ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre la demande de votre Mac dans Verrou, pour l'approuver avec Face ID."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet die Anfrage deines Mac in Verrou, um sie mit Face ID zu genehmigen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre la solicitud de tu Mac en Verrou, para aprobarla con Face ID."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre la richiesta del tuo Mac in Verrou, per approvarla con Face ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the request from your Mac in Verrou, to deny it with Face ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre la demande de votre Mac dans Verrou, pour la refuser avec Face ID."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet die Anfrage deines Mac in Verrou, um sie mit Face ID abzulehnen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre la solicitud de tu Mac en Verrou, para denegarla con Face ID."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre la richiesta del tuo Mac in Verrou, per rifiutarla con Face ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
